


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_23f8f47a:



    voice "2SA_0776"
    sachiko "「好冷……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_2151c221:


    "巡逻完宿舍周边回来了的祥子高耸着肩膀。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_93fd39f4:


    "接下来只要把窗户关上，今晚的巡逻就结束了。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_7ca2f5ae:



    voice "2SA_0777"
    sachiko "「嗯。嗯。嗯。嗯。没问题了吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_4910e05f:


    "把鞋子收进鞋柜，用手点了点四周，检查有没有看漏的。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_bc7557b1:


    "无论什么工作都会认真地完成呢，本性还是一个认真的人啊——"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_b78cb66f:


    "——？"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_9afac94b:


    "祥子有所察觉，朝传来动静的方向看去。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_76b7e4b1:


    "是走廊深处的楼梯传来的。楼梯上撒下微弱的光芒。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_70117d0a:



    voice "2SA_0778"
    sachiko "「……有谁在那么」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_630515ab:


    "祥子转过身来。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_41679910:


    "光是从通向二楼的楼梯传来的。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_c49b03af:


    "祥子蹑手蹑脚地靠近，在楼梯中间的平台处蹲着身子，紧张地朝楼上张望。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_19cd7075:


    "然后——"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_e359e01d:


    "在那里的是圣夜子。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_08f6c9e2:


    "坐在楼梯上用笨拙的手法织着东西。是因为太过专注了么，完全没有察觉到祥子的到来。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_82435b5f:



    voice "2SA_0779"
    sachiko "「唉……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_a964adca:


    "随着一声混合着安心与惊讶的叹息，祥子站起身来。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_66445055:



    voice "2SA_0780"
    sachiko "「都这个时间了在干什么呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_990715fc:



    voice "2MI_0940"
    miyako "「啊、啊哇哇哇！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_8caa12bb:


    "圣夜子惊讶地叫出了声。看到来人是祥子后慌慌张张地把还未完成的围巾藏到身后。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_562e232f:


    "要对祥子保密，这是文给的建议。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_fb799eb5:



    voice "2SA_0781"
    sachiko "「嗯——开始织东西了啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_c1fbbe21:



    voice "2MI_0941"
    miyako "「在、在说什么呢？ 诶，我正想去趟洗手间……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_46d40db4:


    "无论是房间还是洗手间都在一楼。不擅长掩饰啊。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_8f644cd2:



    voice "2SA_0782"
    sachiko "「但是，你藏起来的只是围巾和针棒而已，毛线球之类的可是暴露得一清二楚啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_7d0ce892:



    voice "2MI_0942"
    miyako "「啊……啊哈哈。也是呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_dffa5965:



    voice "2SA_0783"
    sachiko "「为什么要在光线这么昏暗的地方呢？会弄坏眼睛的哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_78f89283:



    voice "2MI_0943"
    miyako "「在房间开灯的话会弄醒那三人的……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_cd304896:



    voice "2SA_0784"
    sachiko "「那样的话来我的——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_ef634f97:


    "祥子突然止住了嘴。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_f9a37711:



    voice "2SA_0785"
    sachiko "「然后呢，进展如何？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_242adb24:



    voice "2MI_0944"
    miyako "「我太蠢了，织得很慢很慢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_05202ddf:


    "圣夜子苦笑着将藏在背后的围巾展开……说展开都有些牵强。横向比纵向要长。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_26cf3915:



    voice "2SA_0786"
    sachiko "「能赶在天还冷的时候织好就好了呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_b9eaae9a:



    voice "2MI_0945"
    miyako "「也是呢……哈啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_d56993e2:



    voice "2SA_0787"
    sachiko "「然后这个点了还不睡没问题么？晚安怪兽？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_b2a2fdc9:



    voice "2MI_0946"
    miyako "「嗯，其实已经好几次差点睡着了——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_ddc7686c:



    voice "2SA_0788"
    sachiko "「笨蛋。快回房间睡觉。会感冒的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_f0dd9a60:



    voice "2MI_0947"
    miyako "「……嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_c90165ce:


    "圣夜子乖乖地收拾好道具。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_dda88780:



    voice "2MI_0948"
    miyako "「晚安」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_7d788b4e:



    voice "2SA_0789"
    sachiko "「晚安」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_278c7e29:


    "………………"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou4_02_c0a59224:



    voice "2SA_0790"
    sachiko "「不带这样的啊，太犯规了」"
